<title>USA: Tower Air names Raymond Vecci COO.</title>
<headline>Tower Air names Raymond Vecci COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tower Air said on Tuesday it named Raymond Vecci executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Vecci was formerly chairman, president and chief executive of Alaska Air Group and Alaska Airlines.  </p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available to say if Vecci was replacing someone as chief operating officer or if the position was new.</p>
